.TH NETCAT 1 "2026-08-16" "notcoreutils" "notcoreutils Manual"
.SH NAME
netcat \- minimal TCP pipe
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B netcat
\fIHOST\fR \fIPORT\fR
.br
.B netcat \-l
\fIPORT\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B "netcat HOST PORT"
connects to HOST:PORT and shuttles stdin/stdout over the socket.
.B "netcat \-l PORT"
listens on PORT for one connection and does the same.
.SH LIMITATIONS
MVP scope: TCP/IPv4 only, one connection, no UDP mode \- a real scope
cut vs full \fBnc\fR(1).
